{"id":"nave:jonathan","source":"nave","name":"Jonathan","slug":"jonathan","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. A Levite of Bethlehem, who becomes a priest for Micah; accepts idolatry; joins the Danites Jud 17:7-13; 18:1-30","refs":[["Judg",17,7,17,13],["Judg",18,1,18,30]]},{"text":"2. Son of Saul 1Sa 14:49","refs":[["1Sam",14,49,14,49]]},{"text":"Victory of, over the Philistine garrison of Geba 1Sa 13:3,4,16","refs":[["1Sam",13,3,13,3],["1Sam",13,4,13,4],["1Sam",13,16,13,16]]},{"text":"Victory of, over the Philistines at Michmash 1Sa 14:1-18","refs":[["1Sam",14,1,14,18]]},{"text":"Under Saul’s curse pronounced against anyone who might take food before Saul was avenged of his enemies 1Sa 14:24-30,43","refs":[["1Sam",14,24,14,30],["1Sam",14,43,14,43]]},{"text":"Rescued by the people 1Sa 14:43-45","refs":[["1Sam",14,43,14,45]]},{"text":"Love of, for David 1Sa 18:1-4; 19:1-7; 20; 23:16-18","refs":[["1Sam",18,1,18,4],["1Sam",19,1,19,7],["1Sam",20,0,20,0],["1Sam",23,16,23,18]]},{"text":"Killed in the battle with the Philistines 1Sa 31:2,6; 1Ch 10:2; 2Sa 21:12-14","refs":[["1Sam",31,2,31,2],["1Sam",31,6,31,6],["1Chr",10,2,10,2],["2Sam",21,12,21,14]]},{"text":"Buried by inhabitants of Jabesh-gilead 1Sa 31:11-13","refs":[["1Sam",31,11,31,13]]},{"text":"Mourned by David 2Sa 1:12,17-27","refs":[["2Sam",1,12,1,12],["2Sam",1,17,1,27]]},{"text":"Son of, cared for by David 2Sa 4:4; 9; 1Ch 8:34","refs":[["2Sam",4,4,4,4],["2Sam",9,0,9,0],["1Chr",8,34,8,34]]},{"text":"3. Son of Abiathar 2Sa 15:27","refs":[["2Sam",15,27,15,27]]},{"text":"Acts as a spy for David 2Sa 15:27,28; 17:17-22","refs":[["2Sam",15,27,15,27],["2Sam",15,28,15,28],["2Sam",17,17,17,22]]},{"text":"Informs Adonijah of Solomon’s succession to David 1Ki 1:42-48","refs":[["1Kgs",1,42,1,48]]},{"text":"4. Nephew of David, kills a giant, and becomes one of David’s chief warriors 2Sa 21:21; 1Ch 20:7","refs":[["2Sam",21,21,21,21],["1Chr",20,7,20,7]]},{"text":"5. One of David’s heroes 2Sa 23:32; 1Ch 11:34","refs":[["2Sam",23,32